You must keep accurate records of your installations and use of the Software for at least 24 months. Once in any 12-month period, on 15 days' notice, Zyvor or an independent auditor bound by confidentiality obligations may inspect those records and the relevant deployments during normal business hours to verify compliance.

If an audit or certification shows use that is not licensed, or under-licensing, you must immediately obtain the appropriate license and pay the amounts due under section 21, and you must also pay the reasonable cost of the audit.

Any compliance verification must be conducted in a commercially reasonable manner and subject to applicable confidentiality obligations.

21. Termination

Your rights under this license terminate automatically and immediately, without notice, if you materially violate its terms. Any Production Use without a valid commercial license, and any use after the Evaluation Period without a valid commercial license or written extension, is a material violation. There is no right to cure a violation of this kind.

Upon termination, you must stop all use of the Software and delete all copies, and you must certify in writing, on request, that you have done so.

For other violations, Zyvor may, at its discretion, provide an opportunity to cure by:

* purchasing an appropriate commercial license;
* reducing the deployment to permitted use; or
* stopping the non-compliant use.

Unauthorized Production Use. If you use the Software in Production without a valid commercial license, you must pay Zyvor, for the whole period of that use, license fees at Zyvor's then-current list price for the Software and the scope of deployment (without discounts), plus a further 100% of those fees as agreed liquidated damages for the cost of detection, enforcement, lost sales, and the harm to Zyvor's licensing program, together with interest at 1.5% per month, or the maximum rate permitted by law if lower, from the date each payment would have been due. The parties agree that this sum is a genuine and reasonable pre-estimate of Zyvor's loss and not a penalty, and it is in addition to Zyvor's other remedies, including damages for infringement.

You must also pay Zyvor's reasonable costs of enforcing this license, including reasonable legal fees, where Zyvor prevails.

Termination does not eliminate any payment obligation arising from unauthorized use, and sections 11, 15, 16, 20, 21, 23 to 26, and 28 to 32 survive termination.

